UID:egybi-ramadan-2027@egybi.com
DTSTAMP:20261120T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270208
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270309
SUMMARY:Ramadan (expected; moon sighting decides)
DESCRIPTION:Gulf News and The National (Oct 2026) give 8 February from astronomical calculation\; Egypt-specific holiday calendars (TrueCalendar\, Calendarific) list 9 February. 29 or 30 days\, set by moon sighting. Source: https://www.thenationalnews.com/news/uae/2026/10/06/ramadan-2027-uae-dates-eid-al-fitr-holiday/ Full table: https://egybi.com/egypt-public-holidays.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:egybi-abu-simbel-sun-feb-2027@egybi.com
DTSTAMP:20261120T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270222
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270223
SUMMARY:Abu Simbel sun alignment
DESCRIPTION:Not a public holiday. The Ministry's ticket list gives a separate ticket for the sun alignment day: 1\,200 EGP for a foreign adult\, against 750 on other days. Its booking site showed 1\,272 EGP when we checked on 17 November 2026. Source: https://www.mota.gov.eg/media/5a2ja2iu/ticket-english-5-11-2024-1.pdf Full table: https://egybi.com/egypt-public-holidays.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
