BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:egybi-karnak-solstice-2027-2027@egybi.com
DTSTAMP:20261120T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271221
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271222
SUMMARY:Karnak winter solstice sunrise
DESCRIPTION:Not a public holiday. Africanews\, reporting with AP\, says the sunrise lines up with the temple walls on 21 December\, the shortest day of the year\, and visitors gather at dawn to watch it. Source: https://www.africanews.com/2025/12/22/egypt-visitors-watch-sun-align-with-ancient-luxor-temple-on-winter-solstice/ Full table: https://egybi.com/egypt-public-holidays.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:egybi-qasr-qarun-solstice-2027-2027@egybi.com
DTSTAMP:20261120T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271221
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271222
SUMMARY:Qasr Qarun winter solstice sunrise
DESCRIPTION:Not a public holiday. Explore Fayoum\, a Fayoum travel site\, describes the sun lining up with this Ptolemaic temple on 21 December\; a second travel site gives about 25 minutes of light in the sanctuary. Source: https://fayoumegypt.com/qasr-qaroun-temple-sun-festival-the-wonder-of-the-sun-21-december-2014 Full table: https://egybi.com/egypt-public-holidays.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
